/**
 * Printing option catalogue.
 *
 * The properties a print shop customer picks from — paper, size, printed sides,
 * finishing, folding, banner hardware, garment colours and so on — modelled on
 * what Helloprint and Bizay offer. This is only the starting catalogue: the
 * owner enables, edits, adds and deletes fields and values from the admin
 * dashboard, and the edited version is stored in settings/optionLibrary.
 *
 * Prices are a NET SEK surcharge per unit on top of the product base price.
 * Every field's default option is free, so a fresh configuration quotes the
 * base price.
 *
 * Nothing here is marked `required`. The configurator preselects a default for
 * every field, so a required flag can only ever fire for a basket filled before
 * the field existed — and then it rejects the payment with an error the shopper
 * has no way to answer. Turn it on per field from the dashboard if a product
 * genuinely must not be ordered without a deliberate choice.
 *
 * 153 fields · 1428 values.
 */
